1
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:01,640
Mark 3

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:06,960
Again he entered the synagogue, and a man was there with a withered hand.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:11,320
And they watched Jesus to see whether he would heal him on the Sabbath,

4
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,200
so that they might accuse him.

5
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:15,800
And he said to the man with the withered hand,

6
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,080
Come here.

7
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:18,680
And he said to them,

8
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:22,620
Is it lawful on the Sabbath to do good or to do harm,

9
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,820
to save life or to kill?

10
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:26,880
But they were silent.

11
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:29,840
And he looked around at them with anger,

12
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,880
grieved at their hardness of heart,

13
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:33,140
and said to the man,

14
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,180
Stretch out your hand.

15
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:38,440
He stretched it out, and his hand was restored.

16
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:44,380
The Pharisees went out and immediately held counsel with the Herodians against him,

17
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:45,920
how to destroy him.

18
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:50,200
Jesus withdrew with his disciples to the sea,

19
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:51,800
and a great crowd followed,

20
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,340
from Galilee and Judea,

21
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,300
and Jerusalem and Injumia,

22
00:00:55,420 --> 00:00:56,860
and from beyond the Jordan,

23
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:59,080
and from around Tyre and Sidon.

24
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:02,240
When the great crowd heard all that he was doing,

25
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,500
they came to him.

26
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:07,520
And he told his disciples to have a boat ready for him

27
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:09,620
because of the crowd, lest they crush him.

28
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:11,280
For he had healed many,

29
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:14,840
so that all who had diseases pressed around him to touch him.

30
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:17,500
And whenever the unclean spirits saw him,

31
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:20,060
they fell down before him and cried out,

32
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,480
You are the Son of God!

33
00:01:23,340 --> 00:01:26,420
And he strictly ordered them not to make him known.

34
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:31,280
And he went up on the mountain and called to him those whom he desired,

35
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,360
and they came to him.

36
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:35,540
And he appointed twelve, whom he also named apostles,

37
00:01:36,060 --> 00:01:37,560
so that they might be with him,

38
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:39,380
and he might send them out to preach,

39
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:41,700
and have authority to cast out demons.

40
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:43,900
He appointed the twelve,

41
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:46,360
Simon, to whom he gave the name Peter,

42
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:48,500
James, the son of Zebedee,

43
00:01:48,660 --> 00:01:50,080
and John, the brother of James,

44
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:52,280
to whom he gave the name Boanerges,

45
00:01:52,700 --> 00:01:53,800
that is, sons of thunder,

46
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:56,680
Andrew, and Philip, and Bartholomew,

47
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:58,580
and Matthew, and Thomas,

48
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,620
and James, the son of Alphaeus,

49
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,240
and Thaddeus, and Simon the Canaanite,

50
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:06,600
and Judas Iscariot, who betrayed him.

51
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:10,660
Then he went home, and the crowd gathered again,

52
00:02:10,820 --> 00:02:12,380
so that they could not even eat.

53
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,760
And when his family heard it,

54
00:02:14,880 --> 00:02:16,240
they went out to seize him,

55
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:18,500
for they were saying, He is out of his mind.

56
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:21,840
And the scribes who came down from Jerusalem were saying,

57
00:02:22,300 --> 00:02:24,300
He is possessed by Beelzebul,

58
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:26,860
and by the prince of demons he casts out,

59
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:27,440
the demons.

60
00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:29,680
And he called them to him,

61
00:02:29,740 --> 00:02:31,140
and said to them in parables,

62
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:34,100
How can Satan cast out Satan?

63
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:36,760
If a kingdom is divided against itself,

64
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:38,600
that kingdom cannot stand.

65
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:41,200
And if a house is divided against itself,

66
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:43,180
that house will not be able to stand.

67
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:46,820
And if Satan has risen up against himself and is divided,

68
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:49,940
he cannot stand but is coming to an end.

69
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:53,340
But no one can enter a strong man's house

70
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:54,440
and plunder his goods

71
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:56,820
unless he first binds the strong man.

72
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:59,180
Then indeed he may plunder his house.

73
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,240
Truly I say to you,

74
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:04,000
all sins will be forgiven the children of man,

75
00:03:04,220 --> 00:03:05,980
and whatever blasphemies they utter.

76
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:08,960
But whoever blasphemes against the Holy Spirit

77
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,080
never has forgiveness,

78
00:03:10,740 --> 00:03:12,780
but is guilty of an eternal sin.

79
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:14,900
For they were saying,

80
00:03:15,460 --> 00:03:17,140
He has an unclean spirit.

81
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,660
And his mother and his brothers came,

82
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:22,680
and standing outside they sent to him and called him.

83
00:03:23,180 --> 00:03:24,920
And a crowd was sitting around him,

84
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,100
and they said to him,

85
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:29,600
Your mother and your brothers are outside seeking you.

86
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:31,140
And he answered them,

87
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,800
Who are my mother and my brothers?

88
00:03:34,340 --> 00:03:37,040
And looking about at those who sat around him,

89
00:03:37,180 --> 00:03:37,620
he said,

90
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:40,120
Here are my mother and my brothers.

91
00:03:40,660 --> 00:03:42,320
For whoever does the will of God,

92
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:45,180
he is my brother and sister and mother.

